This software is a C# port of PKLib, the PKWARE Data Compression Library
implementation by Ladislav Zezula. The imploding and exploding algorithms in
PkLibSharp are derived from the following files, distributed as part of
StormLib:

    src/pklib/implode.c
    src/pklib/explode.c
    src/pklib/crc32.c
    src/pklib/pklib.h

    https://github.com/ladislav-zezula/StormLib

StormLib is used under the MIT License, reproduced in full below.

